{"id": "12", "title": "论语", "author": "孔子及其弟子", "category": "文学名著", "count": 20, "available": 20, "cover": "files/article/image/0/12/12s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/12.htm", "intro": "《论语》是儒家学派的经典著作之一，由孔子的弟子及其再传弟子编纂而成。它以语录体和对话文体为主，记录了孔子及其弟子言行，集中体现了孔子的政治主张、伦理思想、道德观念及教育原则等。通行本《论语》共二十篇。论语的语言简洁精练,含义深刻,其中有许多言论至今仍被世人视为至理。", "base": "files/article/html/0/12", "chapters": [{"title": "学而第一", "file": "822.html", "available": true}, {"title": "为政第二", "file": "823.html", "available": true}, {"title": "八佾第三", "file": "824.html", "available": true}, {"title": "里仁第四", "file": "825.html", "available": true}, {"title": "公冶长第五", "file": "826.html", "available": true}, {"title": "雍也第六", "file": "827.html", "available": true}, {"title": "述而第七", "file": "828.html", "available": true}, {"title": "泰伯第八", "file": "829.html", "available": true}, {"title": "子罕第九", "file": "830.html", "available": true}, {"title": "乡党第十", "file": "831.html", "available": true}, {"title": "先进第十一", "file": "832.html", "available": true}, {"title": "颜渊第十二", "file": "833.html", "available": true}, {"title": "子路第十三", "file": "834.html", "available": true}, {"title": "宪问第十四", "file": "835.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卫灵公第十五", "file": "836.html", "available": true}, {"title": "季氏第十六", "file": "837.html", "available": true}, {"title": "阳货第十七", "file": "838.html", "available": true}, {"title": "微子第十八", "file": "839.html", "available": true}, {"title": "子张第十九", "file": "840.html", "available": true}, {"title": "尧曰第二十", "file": "841.html", "available": true}]}